        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/dungeon-meshi-dd2.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>Have you ever seen - or read - the wonderful Dungeon Meshi (known in English as 'Delicious in Dungeon')? It's a phenomenal manga series written and illustrated by Ryoko Kui, which was adapted into an anime series produced by Trigger in 2024. Long story short, it's about a group of adventurers in a fantasy world who lose an encounter with a dragon - who eats one of the party. What follows is a quest to revive the fallen party member (who happens to be the sister of one of the main characters), with the adventuring party learning to cook and eat monsters in dungeons as they uncover the stranger truth behind the world they inhabit.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/dragons-dogma-2-dungeon-meshi-collaboration-out-now\">Read more</a></p>",
